  "text": "proprium.dominica-xviii-post-pentecosten-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “18th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Strengthened by Your sacred gift, we thank You, O Lord, beseeching Your mercy to make us receive it worthily. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, forever and ever." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
